{"language": "en", "duration": 287.39, "model": "faster-whisper:small", "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 3.9, "text": "This is Akashwani, the news read by Valsa Williams.", "words": [[0.0, 0.3, " This"], [0.3, 0.58, " is"], [0.58, 1.34, " Akashwani,"], [1.78, 1.88, " the"], [1.88, 2.26, " news"], [2.26, 2.86, " read"], [2.86, 3.1, " by"], [3.1, 3.62, " Valsa"], [3.62, 3.9, " Williams."]]}, {"start": 13.66, "end": 18.44, "text": "Prime Minister Narendra Modi today said that India's clean energy transition is gathering", "words": [[13.66, 14.26, " Prime"], [14.26, 14.54, " Minister"], [14.54, 15.06, " Narendra"], [15.06, 15.26, " Modi"], [15.26, 15.54, " today"], [15.54, 15.84, " said"], [15.84, 16.04, " that"], [16.04, 16.48, " India's"], [16.48, 16.8, " clean"], [16.8, 17.22, " energy"], [17.22, 17.92, " transition"], [17.92, 18.08, " is"], [18.08, 18.44, " gathering"]]}, {"start": 18.44, "end": 23.24, "text": "pace with solar power playing a growing role in meeting the country's energy needs.", "words": [[18.44, 18.9, " pace"], [18.9, 19.2, " with"], [19.2, 19.46, " solar"], [19.46, 19.84, " power"], [19.84, 20.16, " playing"], [20.16, 20.42, " a"], [20.42, 20.64, " growing"], [20.64, 21.06, " role"], [21.06, 21.28, " in"], [21.28, 21.5, " meeting"], [21.5, 21.74, " the"], [21.74, 22.28, " country's"], [22.28, 22.74, " energy"], [22.74, 23.24, " needs."]]}, {"start": 23.74, "end": 28.06, "text": "Mr Modi said this while sharing an article written by Union Minister of New and Renewable", "words": [[23.74, 24.02, " Mr"], [24.02, 24.24, " Modi"], [24.24, 24.5, " said"], [24.5, 24.76, " this"], [24.76, 24.94, " while"], [24.94, 25.2, " sharing"], [25.2, 25.42, " an"], [25.42, 25.68, " article"], [25.68, 26.06, " written"], [26.06, 26.32, " by"], [26.32, 26.58, " Union"], [26.58, 26.98, " Minister"], [26.98, 27.2, " of"], [27.2, 27.44, " New"], [27.44, 27.64, " and"], [27.64, 28.06, " Renewable"]]}, {"start": 28.06, "end": 32.9, "text": "Energy Prahlad Joshi and founder of Bloomberg LP, Michael R. Bloomberg.", "words": [[28.06, 28.42, " Energy"], [28.42, 29.12, " Prahlad"], [29.12, 29.8, " Joshi"], [29.8, 30.1, " and"], [30.1, 30.4, " founder"], [30.4, 30.62, " of"], [30.62, 30.94, " Bloomberg"], [30.94, 31.52, " LP,"], [32.02, 32.24, " Michael"], [32.24, 32.52, " R."], [32.76, 32.9, " Bloomberg."]]}, {"start": 32.9, "end": 37.94, "text": "The Prime Minister noted that the article stresses on the growth of renewable energy,", "words": [[32.9, 33.64, " The"], [33.64, 33.9, " Prime"], [33.9, 34.12, " Minister"], [34.12, 34.44, " noted"], [34.44, 34.7, " that"], [34.7, 34.82, " the"], [34.82, 35.1, " article"], [35.1, 35.64, " stresses"], [35.64, 35.94, " on"], [35.94, 36.04, " the"], [36.04, 36.34, " growth"], [36.34, 36.92, " of"], [36.92, 37.36, " renewable"], [37.36, 37.94, " energy,"]]}, {"start": 38.12, "end": 42.44, "text": "the expansion of rooftop solar, and investments in storage and transmission.", "words": [[38.12, 38.2, " the"], [38.2, 38.6, " expansion"], [38.6, 38.92, " of"], [38.92, 39.26, " rooftop"], [39.26, 39.84, " solar,"], [40.26, 40.42, " and"], [40.42, 40.82, " investments"], [40.82, 41.18, " in"], [41.18, 41.5, " storage"], [41.5, 41.96, " and"], [41.96, 42.44, " transmission."]]}, {"start": 42.96, "end": 48.74, "text": "It also highlighted how this shift is helping reduce electricity bills, create jobs, and", "words": [[42.96, 43.08, " It"], [43.08, 43.34, " also"], [43.34, 43.8, " highlighted"], [43.8, 44.44, " how"], [44.44, 44.74, " this"], [44.74, 45.04, " shift"], [45.04, 45.36, " is"], [45.36, 45.66, " helping"], [45.66, 46.1, " reduce"], [46.1, 46.68, " electricity"], [46.68, 47.26, " bills,"], [47.68, 48.0, " create"], [48.0, 48.46, " jobs,"], [48.68, 48.74, " and"]]}, {"start": 48.74, "end": 50.46, "text": "strengthen energy security.", "words": [[48.74, 49.08, " strengthen"], [49.08, 49.78, " energy"], [49.78, 50.46, " security."]]}, {"start": 51.69, "end": 55.47, "text": "Prime Minister Modi wil